# ── MARK LV — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# (git has no end-of-line comments: a "# ..." after a pattern becomes part of
# the pattern and silently stops it matching, so every note sits on its own line)
# Your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials:
config/api_keys.json
# The dashboard's TLS private key and certificate:
config/certs/
# A LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands somebody your WhatsApp
# account, not just a key:
config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens and client secrets (Gmail / Calendar plugins):
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

# ── Dados de uso criados em tempo de execução (fork João Gabriel) ─────────────
memory/organizer.json
memory/usage.json
memory/briefing_state.json
memory/music_cache/
*.lnk

# ── The voice ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# voz_local/referencia.wav IS committed: it is the assistant's one voice.
# The rest is per-machine: the voice model's own Python, its log, test output.
voz_local/.venv/
voz_local/teste_voz.wav
voz_local/referencia.mp3
